  "setRotationAngles": "head.pitch = headPitch / 57.295776F;\nhead.yaw = netHeadYaw / 57.295776F;\nrightLeg.pitch = (float)Math.cos(limbSwing * 0.6662F) * 1.4F * limbSwingAmount;\nleftLeg.pitch = (float)Math.cos(limbSwing * 0.6662F + Math.PI) * 1.4F * limbSwingAmount;\nrightArm.pitch = (float)Math.cos(limbSwing * 0.6662F + Math.PI) * 0.7F * limbSwingAmount - (float)Math.PI / 10;\nleftArm.pitch = (float)Math.cos(limbSwing * 0.6662F) * 1.4F * limbSwingAmount;"
